{"id": "Hint::RHT_GANONDORF_HINT_LA_ONLY::433", "plain_text": "Ha ha ha... You'll never beat me by reflecting my lightning bolts and unleashing the arrows from #[1]#!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_GANONDORF_HINT_LA_ONLY", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_GANONDORF_HINT_MS_ONLY::434", "plain_text": "Ha ha ha... You'll never defeat me, drop a castle on me and finish me off with the sacred blade from #[2]#!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_GANONDORF_HINT_MS_ONLY", "variables": ["2"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_SHEIK_HINT_LA_ONLY::435", "plain_text": "I overheard Ganondorf say that he misplaced the #Light Arrows# in #[1]#.", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_SHEIK_HINT_LA_ONLY", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_DAMPE_DIARY::436", "plain_text": "Whoever reads this, please enter #[1]#. I will let you have my #stretching, shrinking keepsake#.\n--- PAGE ---\nI'm waiting for you.\n--Dampé", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_DAMPE_DIARY", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_GREG_HINT::437", "plain_text": "By the way, if you're interested, I saw the shiniest #Green Rupee# somewhere in #[1]#.\n--- PAGE ---\nIt's said to have #mysterious powers#...\n--- PAGE ---\nBut then, it could just be another regular rupee.\nOh well.", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_GREG_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_SARIA_TALK_HINT::438", "plain_text": "Did you feel the #surge of magic# recently? A mysterious bird told me it came from #[1]#.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou should check that place out, @!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_SARIA_TALK_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_SARIA_SONG_HINT::439", "plain_text": "Did you feel the #surge of magic# recently? A mysterious bird told me it came from #[1]#.\n--- PAGE ---\nYou should check that place out, @!\\x0B", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_SARIA_SONG_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_MIDO_HINT::440", "plain_text": "You'll never find the #Kokiri Sword# I hid in #[1]#!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_MIDO_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_LOACH_HINT::441", "plain_text": "What?\n--- PAGE ---\nYou wanna know about the\nrHyrule Loachw?\n--- PAGE ---\nIt's a big fish, but it's so rare that I'll give my g[1]w to anyone who catches it. Seriously!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_LOACH_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_FISHING_POLE_HINT::442", "plain_text": "--- PAGE ---\nIf I remember correctly, I lost it somewhere in #[1]#...\nLet me know if you find it!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_FISHING_POLE_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_CHICKENS_HINT::443", "plain_text": "You! Please!\nBring my Cucco's back to my pen!\nI'll give you my #[1]#!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_CHICKENS_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_BIGGORON_HINT::444", "plain_text": "Arrrrrre you here to claim my finest #[1]#? Shoooooow me your #Claim Check#.", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_BIGGORON_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_FROGS_HINT::445", "plain_text": "Some frogs holding #[1]# are looking at you from underwater...", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_FROGS_HINT", "variables": ["1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_SKULLS_HINT::446", "plain_text": "Yeaaarrgh! I'm cursed!!\n--- PAGE ---\nPlease save me by destroying #[d] Spiders of the Curse# and I will give you my #[1]#!", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_SKULLS_HINT", "variables": ["d", "1"]}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_GANON_JOKE01::447", "plain_text": "Oh! It's @.\nI was expecting someone called Sheik.\nDo you know what happened to them?", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_GANON_JOKE01", "variables": []}
{"id": "Hint::RHT_GANON_JOKE02::448", "plain_text": "I knew I shouldn't have put the key on the other side of my door.", "category": "RANDOMIZER", "subcategory": "RHT_GANON_JOKE02", "variables": []}
